<title>UK: Vosper Thornycroft H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Vosper Thornycroft H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		25.8		   vs 23.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.5		    vs 6.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     12.7		   vs 11.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   107.3		  vs 114.5</p>
<p> Operating profit	 10.1		   vs 7.5</p>
<p> Interest receivable    2.7		    vs 3.9</p>
<p> Tax			  4.3		    vs 3.8</p>
<p> Net taxed		  8.4		    vs 7.7</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 15, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov 26  Ex-div date		Nov 18</p>
<p>NOTE: Vosper Thornycroft Holdings Plc designs and builds naval ships.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
